<style>
  .vellano-test-section {
    background-color: #faf9f5;
    padding: 0 20px 80px 20px;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
  }
  .vellano-test-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #111;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 60px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .vellano-test-kicker {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #B8A07A;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .vellano-test-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
  }
  .vellano-test-quote {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-family: 'Bodoni Moda', serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .vellano-test-author {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #B8A07A;
  }

  @media(max-width: 768px) {
    .vellano-test-container {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .vellano-test-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .vellano-test-quote {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="vellano-test-section">
  <div class="vellano-test-container">
    <div class="vellano-test-kicker">ENDORSED BY PROFESSIONALS</div>
    
    <div class="vellano-test-grid">
      <div class="vellano-test-slide">
        <div class="vellano-test-quote">"Hard water calcium is the number one cause of disrupted skin barriers. Vellano's filtration system is the first thing I recommend to patients struggling with dry, reactive skin."</div>
        <div class="vellano-test-author">- DR. ELENA ROSTOVA, DERMATOLOGIST</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vellano-test-slide">
        <div class="vellano-test-quote">"I've tested every shower filter on the market. Nothing strips away heavy metals while maintaining water pressure quite like Vellano. It's an absolute game-changer for colour-treated hair."</div>
        <div class="vellano-test-author">- MARCUS CHEN, CELEBRITY STYLIST</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Vellano Testimonials",
  "presets": [{"name":"Vellano Testimonials"}]
}
{% endschema %}
